+## One-time prospective result
+
+After explicit coordinator release, `__PRIVATE_HOME__/LEGACY_TRIAL_CAPTURE.jpeg` was evaluated in one frozen pipeline run in the fresh exclusive `pilot-v1-prospective` path. The original file remained outside Git and unchanged at SHA-256 `0c9f2d85491fc0e58d654bd5592ab60fee2ab2e662919434b764c4d2777d276d`; it is a 3,359,696-byte RGB JPEG, 3072×4096. Its transfer/filter history remains unverified, so the observed category is `real_camera_transfer_unknown_confirmation`. The preregistered WhatsApp-document category is retained only as an explicit deviation, not asserted as fact.
+
+| Profile | Status | Prospective result |
+|---|---|---|
+| Hard asymmetric | scored | row 0 score `923.889567`, rank 1; threshold `1142.689839`; no accused row; abstain |
+| Global signed-soft | evidence failure | frozen content mask retained 1,675 pixels; required 4,096; no scores computed |
+| Local-mixture signed-soft | evidence failure | shared frozen global fit unavailable; no scores computed |
+
+For hard evidence, the highest non-target score was `511.115443` (row 226), sign BER against row 0 was `0.473638`, the conditional margin was `-218.800272`, and the unchanged historical-2100 decision also abstained. All 1,000 hard scores are retained in prospective `scores.json`; failed soft profiles correctly have no fabricated score vector.
+
+Content-only registration passed before scoring: ORB/RANSAC retained 174 of 326 ratio-test matches, registered gradient similarity was `0.618005`, and ECC-affine coefficient was `0.501326`. These alignment diagnostics do not turn a below-threshold score into attribution.
+
+The frozen runner regenerated the prior 19 cases to enforce its full inventory. All 19 capture hashes, all 41 previously prepared arrays, and all 57 prior case/profile status/outcome/score vectors reproduced exactly. They are integrity duplicates, not new independent measurements, and are not added to the earlier counts.
+
+Prospective runtime was 35.43 s / 504,364 KiB for fixtures, 60.55 s / 681,672 KiB for preparation, and 5.36 s / 375,192 KiB for scoring. Exact commands are in `evidence/pilot-v1-prospective/command.log`.
+
